{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>前 Cookies 成員、現年41歲的楊愛瑾（Miki）自嫁給永安太子爺郭永淳後，專心相夫教子過住幸福闊太生活。近日她分享最新的影片和圖片，記錄一家四口齊齊返中山尋根的溫馨點滴，羨煞旁人。</p><figure><img alt=\"一家四口遊中山。（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168911755632578560637512.jpeg/tz8p2CFRfkHwLrANeMthYyUUpR1V49wH0BIAEtASABI\"/><figcaption>一家四口遊中山。（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure><p>帶寶貝仔女返中山家鄉尋根</p><p>楊愛瑾近日在社交平台上載了一條短片，記錄一家人回到中山家鄉的行程。她特意帶同一對活潑可愛的仔女同行，讓小朋友親身走訪祖輩生活過的地方，感受當地文化氣息。這趟尋根之旅除了吃喝玩樂，更充滿教育意義，絕對是超用心的好媽媽。</p><figure><img alt=\"帶小朋友了解中山歷史。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168912142313721856467291.png/GK5CP6MTyHyw2RgHMIsi6hzTXmDQa8dXK5mVLSuZlS0\"/><figcaption>帶小朋友了解中山歷史。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩個小朋友好認真。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168912144880766976315982.png/VT_mR2HhgGipuEfkt84hXIj2qK5lCvS4pme7TqZnu04\"/><figcaption>兩個小朋友好認真。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"走入有機農場。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168912149608009728436127.png/lunU52V06cRekpbw2vD7YyiipeKozcf8dHbMtHR2zLQ\"/><figcaption>走入有機農場。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"親近大自然。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168912147359731712501736.png/k8ajrPI31fry7XHDcajDzuiIZeTVCfmzhAufp4QLn6c\"/><figcaption>親近大自然。（小紅書@Miki楊愛瑾）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"親近大自然。（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168913310109011968236498.jpeg/rlqL_MTw3OSNqalzCm1GuDYO-FsY78fxLcQI6i3ECOo\"/><figcaption>親近大自然。（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure><p>楊愛瑾甜蜜依偎老公郭永淳舉V放閃</p><p>除了溫馨親子互動，片中當然不少得放閃環節。楊愛瑾與老公結婚多年依然恩愛如昔，兩人在鏡頭前大曬甜蜜，楊愛瑾更小鳥依人般緊緊依偎住老公，齊齊對著鏡頭開心舉起「V」字手勢，幸福笑容完全藏不住。</p><figure><img alt=\"好幸福！（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168911751702384640769521.jpeg/9zvcCUnWAKKMdTC6kB-AF0KkPn2xP-FVr1x_I69cfyM\"/><figcaption>好幸福！（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"甜蜜放閃。（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168890319387758592058376.jpeg/S8-Tzn5CO6HrTDI5LsXTXUeGAQX38NYcs6IBS7OiAUs\"/><figcaption>甜蜜放閃。（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure><p>闊太保養得宜獲網民大讚狀態極Fit</p><p>雖然已是兩孩之母，但楊愛瑾的樣貌與身材依然Keep得非常之好。片中的她打扮休閒又不失少女感，皮膚白滑緊緻。不少網民看完影片後都紛紛留言大讚她狀態極佳，羨慕她擁有如此美滿的家庭生活。</p><figure><img alt=\"楊愛瑾保養得好好。（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168913307248365568835902.jpeg/t3EvlFzb9XW3QLHMhxQR6MyWPcu1TxP3rx7-1q8e_tY\"/><figcaption>楊愛瑾保養得好好。（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"戴着彩色編織草帽及墨鏡。（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168913304853286912593862.jpeg/LRMQWCJvvm4kpO9yNnENWvehI7bOIvF5NYP13zWD9d8\"/><figcaption>戴着彩色編織草帽及墨鏡。（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"少女感十足。（IG@mikiyeung）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260825/1168913302370127872517428.jpeg/eEjYBm2muFiVV1GnVB0FKHgKPx2QkPGFel0UYnpdFGI\"/><figcaption>少女感十足。（IG@mikiyeung）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T11:20:11.042359+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":680,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}